        },
        {
          "text": "big mistake. Every ball team needs a guy named \"Babe\".",
          "likes": 2,
          "author": "rbingham.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Great guy, works hard, but he plays in that “just barely good enough” area where he can’t consistently do well in MLB. Will miss the stache and the attitude, hope someone picks him up.",
