      "text": "Troy Melton was not yet arb eligible, having just over a year of service time. His 6-year, $46.5m extension pending physical is the longest contract for a Tigers pitcher since Verlander's 7-year extension in 2013. It would cover Melton's arb years plus a year of free agency, 2 with a club option.",
